sequenceDiagram
    participant V as View component
    participant C as apiClient
    participant S as Server REST API
    V->>C: getPolicies()
    C->>S: GET /api/v1/... (cookies, X-CSRF-Token on writes)
    alt 401 Unauthorized
        C->>S: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (bor_refresh cookie)
        S-->>C: new bor_session (and bor_csrf)
        C->>S: retry with fresh X-CSRF-Token
    end
    alt still 401
        C-->>V: throw Error
        C->>V: bor:session-expired event -> Shell shows login
    else ok
        S-->>C: JSON
        C-->>V: typed result
    end
